    {
      "id": "93:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:22937:22939"
    },
    {
      "id": "93:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "换了一身新衣服让你感觉神清气爽。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:22939:22957"
    },
    {
      "id": "93:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "现在这个下午，除了继续等伴侣回来，你还能做些什么？希望他/她已经知道怎么修供电了。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:22957:23000"
    },
    {
      "id": "93:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要做些饭吃，转到 94。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:23000:23014"
    },
    {
      "id": "93:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要寻找手电筒和电池，以备天黑时用，转到 95。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:23014:23039"
    },
    {
      "id": "93:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "要试着自己恢复供电，转到 368。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:23039:23058"
    }
  ]
}
